      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The nonce (which is a technical term in cryptography) is a random value rather than a unique value to prevent guessing of the instance ID, as documented in https://vrchatapi.github.io/tutorials/instances/\nIt could be replaced with a term like \"Key\" or \"Instance Key\".",
